Brand logos (the Brands pack)
-----------------------------

The logo shapes are path data copied at build time by scripts/generate-brands.mjs
from two packages. Only the path data ends up in the plugin.

Simple Icons (https://simpleicons.org), version 16.36.0
License: CC0 1.0 Universal (public domain dedication)
https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/

Tabler Icons (https://tabler.io/icons), version 3.49.0
Used for the Windows, Amazon Web Services, Microsoft Azure, Minecraft and
PowerShell logos, which Simple Icons does not carry.

